  /Alt (EARL Industry entity architecture. The ordinary Industry parent graph is rooted at All Industries and branches to Private Industries and Government. Private Industries contains curated intermediate Private Goods and Private Services branches, with representative descendants shown. Tech is a cross-cutting public aggregate outside the ordinary parent graph and has no parent. The Hospitals and Nursing/Residential historical bridge is shown as a special historical entity rather than an ordinary current taxonomy node. Hierarchy traversal uses parent_entity_id; hierarchy_level is descriptive.)
