6182 0 obj
<<
  /Type /StructElem
  /S /Figure
  /P 6181 0 R
  /Alt (EARL validation gates. Six reader-facing validation gates run from methodological inputs through raw acquisition, harmonization and reconciliation, semantic and accounting validation, public-data validation, and publication use by the Statistical Release and website. Each gate tests assumptions at the stage where they become observable. Blocking failures stop the affected build or publication step until resolved; diagnostic findings are recorded and reviewed without altering otherwise valid observations.)
