6403 0 obj
<<
  /Type /StructElem
  /S /Figure
  /P 6402 0 R
  /Alt (Historical Industry splice logic. For eligible current-dollar measures, verified historical BEA evidence is used through 1996 and current BEA evidence takes precedence from 1997 onward; the overlap is not averaged. For price and quantity indexes, EARL preserves the historical growth path and re-anchors the historical segment at the current 1997 reference level.)
