6527 0 obj
<<
  /Type /StructElem
  /S /Figure
  /P 6526 0 R
  /Alt (Corporate statement construction. The Corporate statement begins at Gross Profit, translated from BEA Gross Value Added, because the Corporate source account does not provide a comparable Gross Revenue and Cost of Goods Sold layer. EARL calculates EBITDA as Gross Profit less Operating Expenses. Operating Income (EBIT) remains source-reported BEA Net Operating Surplus, and Income Before Taxes (EBT) with IVA and CCAdj remains source-reported BEA Corporate Profits with IVA and CCAdj. Horizontal rules show statement order rather than direct arithmetic derivation.)
  /A [<<
    /O /Layout
    /Placement /Block
  >>]
