  /Type /StructElem
  /S /Figure
  /P 6568 0 R
  /Alt (National statement construction. Gross Revenue minus Cost of Goods Sold equals Gross Profit. Annual National uses EBITDA (Reported BEA Gross Operating Surplus) as the primary EBITDA analogue. Quarterly National uses EBITDA (Calculated), equal to Gross Profit less Operating Expenses. Calculated EBITDA less Depreciation and the Statistical Discrepancy reconciles approximately to source-reported Net Operating Surplus, presented as Operating Income (EBIT).)
